 "description": "A company's SEC filings, or the whole market's: 10-K (annual report, including 10-KT), 10-Q (quarterly report), 8-K (current report), 20-F and 40-F (foreign companies' annual reports), each with its amendments (/A), newest first, since 2009. Each row: accession, form, the 8-K item codes with their descriptions (for example 2.02 Results of operations, 4.02 Non-reliance on previously issued financial statements, 5.02 Departure or appointment of directors or officers), filed_date, accepted_at (ISO 8601 UTC), period_of_report (the period end for 10-K and 10-Q, the event date for 8-K), the company with its ticker, url (the company's filings page on livermore.club), sec_url (the main document on SEC.gov) and index_url (the SEC filing index with all exhibits). Livermore does not store the text of filings. To learn what an 8-K reports, or a 10-K or 10-Q's business description, risk factors or management's discussion, fetch sec_url; the press release of an 8-K with Item 2.02 is usually exhibit EX-99.1, listed on index_url. With ticker or cik the company's whole history is searchable (filings under a former CIK included). Without either, the query covers the whole market (companies with a ticker) and at most 30 days of filing dates (default: the last 7 days); note says when the range was narrowed. items keeps 8-K filings with any of the given item codes. At most 200 rows per call; use page.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "properties": {
   "cik": {
    "description": "The company's SEC CIK instead of a ticker, e.g. 0000320193. Give ticker or cik, not both.",
    "pattern": "^(CIK)?\\d{1,10}$",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "forms": {
    "description": "Form types, each including its amendments (/A); 10-K also includes 10-KT. Default all, e.g. [\"10-K\",\"10-Q\"].",
    "items": {
     "enum": [
      "10-K",
      "10-Q",
      "8-K",
      "20-F",
      "40-F"
     ],
     "type": "string"
    },
    "maxItems": 5,
    "minItems": 1,
    "type": "array"
   },
   "from": {
    "description": "Earliest filing date, YYYY-MM-DD (US Eastern).",
    "pattern": "^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "items": {
    "description": "8-K item codes; a filing matches when it has any of them, e.g. [\"4.01\",\"4.02\",\"5.02\"]. Only 8-K and 8-K/A filings have items.",
    "items": {
     "pattern": "^\\d\\.\\d{2}$",
     "type": "string"
    },
    "maxItems": 33,
    "minItems": 1,
    "type": "array"
   },
   "limit": {
    "default": 25,
    "description": "Maximum rows to return (1-200, default 25).",
    "maximum": 200,
    "minimum": 1,
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "page": {
    "default": 1,
    "description": "Page number starting at 1; each page has `limit` rows. Check has_more.",
    "maximum": 500,
    "minimum": 1,
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "ticker": {
    "description": "Only this company's filings, whole history (including filings under a former CIK).",
    "maxLength": 12,
    "minLength": 1,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "to": {
    "description": "Latest filing date, YYYY-MM-DD, inclusive.",
    "pattern": "^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "type": "object"
 },
